deepines-store (1.5.0-1) stable; urgency=low

  * Add flow layout and card animations.
  * Use startSystemMove() to move the window.
  * Add setting to change the number of Home apps.
  * Merge about dialog inside the main window.
  * Refactor: Merge EventsMixin in AppearanceMixin.
  * Fix leaking, use subprocess, and select row item.
  * Card loading optimizations.
  * Optimize downloading icons for Flatpak.
  * Fix the display and download of cards.
  * Add support for local version, compare with remote.
  * Rename "Review apps" to "Review actions".

 -- Amaro Martínez <xoas@airmail.cc>  Mon, 29 Jun 2026 22:02:26 -0500

deepines-store (1.5.0) stable; urgency=low

  * Make the store be able to update itself.
  * Add auto update support and unify settings.
  * Force refresh apt/flatpak on demand and at launch.
  * Sync window radius via DBus.
  * Save window position and reorganize mixins.
  * Add secondary button for uninstalling when update is available.
  * Fix update listing, error reporting, and better error handling.
  * Fix version reporting for installed Flatpak apps.
  * Fix workers not dying early and being stuck.
  * Alternative LoadingScreen fix + close, minimize support.
  * Update banners and app icons.
  * Update translations.

