deepines-store (1.4.0) stable; urgency=low

  * Added support for Flatpak apps from the Flathub repository.
  * Added support for uninstalling installed apps.
  * New "Installed apps" category.
  * Reduced the size of SVG resources.
  * Fixed About window opening more than once.
  * Updated banners.
  * Fixed usage of user language and theme instead of root's.
  * Fixed UTF-8 decoding for app data scraping.

  [ New translations ]
  * Simplified Chinese (Calcitem, yangyangdaji).
  * French (J. Lavoie).
  * Italian (J. Lavoie, Antonello Pirina).
